sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API / job entry point
    participant PlaceCmd as PlaceOrderCommand
    participant CreateCmd as CreateOrderCommand
    participant ReserveCmd as ReserveStockCommand
    API->>+PlaceCmd: Dispatch through command pipeline
    Note over PlaceCmd,ReserveCmd: Nested commands use their wrapped handlers / command pipeline
    PlaceCmd->>+CreateCmd: Create order
    CreateCmd-->>-PlaceCmd: Order ID or error
    alt Order created
        PlaceCmd->>+ReserveCmd: Reserve stock for Order ID
        ReserveCmd-->>-PlaceCmd: Result or error
    else Creation failed
        Note over PlaceCmd: Skip reservation and report failure
    end
    PlaceCmd-->>-API: One process result or error
    Note over API: Map the outcome, no business sequencing here
    Note over PlaceCmd,ReserveCmd: With unit of work attached, nested local writes join it, external effects need a consistency design